'''Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals''' (電脳学園ギャラクシーギャルズ ''Dennō Gakuen Gyarakushī Gyaruzu'') is one of the Rare Cat Capsule events in Battle Cats. It was added in [[Version 2.1 Update|Version 2.1]] and is the fourth Rare Cat Capsule Event. The [[Version 8.0 Update|8.0 Update]] introduced new hidden units called Legend Rares, one of which is part of this event: [[Jeanne (Legend Rare Cat)|Jeanne]]. The most recent addition this set is [[Raclesa (Uber Rare Cat)|Raclesa]], who was added on November 6th, 2025 in the [[Version 15.0 Update]].

To unlock this banner in [[The Battle Cats Unite!|The Battle Cats Unite]], the player needs to clear [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]] in the '''Japanese''' ('''JP''') and '''International''' ('''WW''') versions and [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]] in the '''Southeast Asia''' ('''SEA''') version.

